# To configure a custom domain for your GitHub Pages site:
# 1. Rename this file to `CNAME` (without any extension)
# 2. Place it in the `public/` directory so Vite copies it into `dist/` on build
# 3. Put your custom domain on the first line (e.g., yourdomain.com or clinicaldermalab.com)
#
# clinicaldermalab.com
